# rasayan — src/tca.cyr: Rust 1.2.0's TCA tests, ported
# Stdlib auto-included via cyrius.cyml
#
# The 26 unit tests of `tca.rs` and the 2 integration tests (tests/integration.rs) that call only glycolysis and TCA,
# as they are written; tests/golden/tca.tsv checks every method, single step, trajectory and the glycolysis-to-TCA
# coupling besides. Beyond them: the trace event, the crate-private accumulate the metabolic network calls, the
# step-rate view and the codecs' refusals.

